<a name="13"></a>
## 13. Product Roadmap

### MVP (V1.0) — Prove the Loop
**Goal:** Validate that AI can produce useful Scope Packages, that matched subs will bid, and that award → compliance activation works in 3 metros.

**In scope:**
- PDF + image plan upload; sheet classification; OCR; symbol detection for a limited element set (walls, doors, windows, fixtures, panels, columns)
- MasterFormat-grouped Scope Packages with GC edit/confirm
- Deterministic permit roadmap for launch jurisdictions (source-linked)
- Sub verification: license API + COI upload/parse + work radius + trades
- Matching, sealed bidding, bid leveling, award
- Digital subcontract (template + e-sign) and transaction fee collection
- Compliance Ledger activation + permit acknowledgement
- GC Command Center + Scope Studio + Bid Leveling; Sub mobile bid/work views

**Out of scope for MVP:** Native DWG/RVT parsing, Code Change Radar, white-label packages, Procore/Autodesk integrations, advanced pricing intelligence.

**Success gate to exit MVP:** ≥3 median bids per posted scope, >70% scope accept rate, first $1M cumulative GMV, <5% permit dispute rate in launch metros.

### V1.5 — Liquidity & Trust Hardening (≈3 Months Post-MVP)
- Expand to 2–3 additional metros and deepen trade coverage
- Stronger circumvention detection and dispute workflows
- Sub capacity signals and improved match ranking with early performance data
- Fee/timeline estimator refinements from observed award data
- GC invite-known-sub path ("Assign Manually") alongside marketplace post, so existing relationships still land in the Compliance Ledger

### V2.0 — Compliance System of Record (≈6 Months Post-MVP)
- Code Change Radar live monitoring and impact alerts
- Native DWG / RVT ingestion path
- Portfolio-level compliance health scoring and insurer-ready closeout reports
- In-platform messaging v2 with richer clarification threads attached to scope line items
- Business-tier features: white-labeled bid packages, priority support tooling

### V3.0 — Network Intelligence Layer (≈12+ Months Post-MVP)
- Proprietary pricing intelligence ("what similar scopes awarded for in this metro")
- Chat-with-plans RAG for GC/sub clarification (advisory only; never final permit authority)
- Public API + Procore / Autodesk Construction Cloud integrations
- Anonymized market reports for insurers, manufacturers, and capital partners
- Optional expediter / concierge network for white-glove permit filing in top metros

